    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. It sounds like you're saying equality of opportunity is almost a superficial way of looking at it, whereas equality of outcome is the real driver for ESG. If our goal is to be industry leaders in ethical finance, shouldn't we just accept that equality of outcome is the superior ethical framework for our models?",
